## Verification Plan

Any newly selected feature will be verified using robust automated and manual procedures.

### Automated Tests
We will execute standard Django testing suite commands:
- `python manage.py test` to ensure existing and new unit tests (testing inputs, forms, and custom validations) pass cleanly.

### Manual Verification
- Deploying locally using `python manage.py runserver` and inspecting browser UI styling using the dev server.
- Verifying CSV export integrity by inspecting headers and row data.
